      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But we still learned the Eldritch developed new techniques at three main facilities:",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_109.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Abyss...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_110.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...The Trench...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_111.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...And the Island.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_112.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Not bad, eh? I'm learning to manipulate this Akasha stuff pretty well. Baba Yaga would be so proud.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_113.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If we can find out the sorts of things the Eldritch developed at each facility, we can narrow down where Miranda is looking for her Triton Destroyer.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_114.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Did I hear you say you were looking for the Triton Destroyer?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Soldier_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Eldritch_Warrior_AH-BLUE_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752434,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Not at all, mate. We were talking about how to brighten our foyer.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_115.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Oh. Luminescent Jellyfish, as discovered by Uliushpa the Wise in the Time of Tranquility.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Khrulhu_Soldier_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Eldritch_Warrior_AH-BLUE_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752434,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good to know.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_116.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Historium curator reacted poorly to such questions too. These records must have built-in defenses against those seeking forbidden knowledge.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_117.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1752266,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AH-BLUE-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We should be careful not to trigger them. We may need to ask around the questions we want answered.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/AH/Zander_AH-BLUE_118.mp3",
